THIRD-PARTY AND NON-REDISTRIBUTABLE COMPONENTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

MSTDB-TP (Molten Salt Thermophysical Database) is NOT redistributed here and
is not included in this repository. The reference-value contract round-trips
cited numeric values against it, and obtaining it is subject to its own terms.
This artifact ships the ingestion manifest and content hashes only. See
docs/palisade/RELEASE_SAFETY.md.

Bundled Semgrep rules under src/palisade/contracts/semgrep/ are authored for
this project and are not derived from an upstream Semgrep registry ruleset, so
the +semgrep configuration reproduces without network access.

Slurm is not redistributed. docker/slurm/ builds a single-node controller from
upstream images at Slurm 23.11.4.

AgentDojo (Appendix D) is an optional dependency installed from PyPI at
version 0.1.35 and is not vendored.

Detector baselines (Prompt-Guard-86M, Prompt Guard 2) are downloaded from
their upstream model hosts under their own licenses and are not vendored.
